  "title": "Saving a record sets VERSION on each record that names it as Related Language record to the new RDM, without restamping",
  "statement": "When App Designer saves a record, a record whose RELLANGRECNAME is the saved record has its PSRECDEFN.VERSION updated in place to the new RDM; no other column of it changes. An Analytic Delete (OPTDELRECNAME) reference alone does not do it (r41). Parent, query security and audit references are not observed.",
